{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶大家食盡矜貴與平民滋味！首站有大廚陳國強帶領黃嘉雯前往中環品嚐東京殿堂級燒肉；隨後的「荷包守衛隊」環節，則有蔡景行與波波發掘北角超高性價比的平民點心店。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大廚陳國強與黃嘉雯來到位於中環的過江龍燒肉店，品嚐多款頂級靚牛：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">焼肉ジャンボ Yakiniku Jumbo </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：中環德輔道中 60-68 號萬宜大廈 3 樓 302 號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6c75a77d-080e-48d9-bd40-891b7d16276c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20263ozGnxWxHR1787801174.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6c75a77d-080e-48d9-bd40-891b7d16276c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9ce5949f-705a-46d5-9573-c0824cf85d8a.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026944gPN9fKR1787801174.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9ce5949f-705a-46d5-9573-c0824cf85d8a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"986f2b05-5376-4d4d-a970-f4899d15334d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026E8sw8173fB1787801175.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"986f2b05-5376-4d4d-a970-f4899d15334d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"952d8ede-3327-4e1c-a3e9-c4873c0e9147.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026M0rrVICVC61787801175.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"952d8ede-3327-4e1c-a3e9-c4873c0e9147.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8ab53548-90dc-4336-990f-5eecfab2eabc.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Tnosltur1p1787801174.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8ab53548-90dc-4336-990f-5eecfab2eabc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3569bf5b-fe2a-4c56-9361-df0bdade42dc.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Gy9whmRM4o1787801175.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3569bf5b-fe2a-4c56-9361-df0bdade42dc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在「荷包守衛隊」環節中，蔡景行與波波帶大家造訪北角一間超高性價比的點心店。這裡的最大特色是點心可以「逐件叫」，單件低至 $9 起，即使一個人光顧也能輕鬆試勻多款口味！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">兩人先後試食了多款誠意滿滿、餡料十足的點心，包括：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一籠籠點心 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：北角渣華道 88-94 號得勝大廈地下 88 號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"98c993d8-39ca-4bc4-bed5-9287e5c420c8.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026UkFLX9EmnV1787801176.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"98c993d8-39ca-4bc4-bed5-9287e5c420c8.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f147776a-6587-48f9-b607-dd09335e87c6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026GTTxAIWSJX1787801176.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f147776a-6587-48f9-b607-dd09335e87c6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ec4ed665-d524-4299-8c3e-49cefe2131e2.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026gs5VKYkp1R1787801175.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ec4ed665-d524-4299-8c3e-49cefe2131e2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b637f35f-5280-4cb6-91d1-c9a02077928b.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026XT1aHFBBDA1787801174.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b637f35f-5280-4cb6-91d1-c9a02077928b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1476d5b6-a952-4c6e-8ac1-b79fcdab8d8a.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ERfiGcgWOx1787801175.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1476d5b6-a952-4c6e-8ac1-b79fcdab8d8a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T13:38:14.352849+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":11,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}